  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing a Trademark**\n\nI\'m focusing on crafting a sophisticated trademark strip for the website\'s base, aiming for a high-fashion studio aesthetic rather than a typical web footer. It\'s meant to be a signature element. I\'m taking a look at other high-end fashion sites for inspiration, to nail the design.\n\n\n**Refining Bottom Elements**\n\nI\'m now contemplating the final architectural colophon bar. Should it seamlessly extend the cyclorama floor\'s `#E0DFDC`, or have a warm alabaster `#FBF9F5` background? The latter would frame the marble band like a gallery plate, while the former blends it. I\'m leaning toward the `#FBF9F5` option with a hairline border for that extra bespoke touch.\n\n\n**Finalizing Visuals**\n\nI\'ve decided on `#FBF9F5` for the colophon\'s background, with a subtle border and padding for clean contrast. This perfectly matches the footer\'s palette. I\'m now crafting an elevated signature for Anurag, considering a balanced horizontal layout with a small ornament, such as a star or diamond. I\'m focusing on the overall studio signature feel.\n\n\n**Considering Trademark Options**\n\nI\'m now exploring the optimal trademark layout. I\'m leaning toward a sleek, single-row colophon strip, possibly centered for maximum impact, to make \"Made by Anurag\342\204\242\" the focal point. I\'m weighing different phrasing like \"Made by\" or \"Crafted & Designed by\" with a crisp inline SVG star matching the RollingMarble motif and a serif font for Anurag, or a clean tracked uppercase sans-serif. I want a genuinely luxurious and personal feel.\n\n\n**Refining the Signature**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the trademark\'s text. I\'m considering phrases like \"Crafted by Anurag\342\204\242\" or \"Made by Anurag\342\204\242.\" I\'ll use a refined serif font for \"Anurag\342\204\242,\" with the trademark symbol. I\'m thinking a centered layout with subtle dividers on each side, maybe a hairline. Also, I\'ll add a \'creator\' field to the configuration file for easy updating.\n\n\n"
