  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Hover Animation**\n\nI\'m now focused on validating the interactive \"O\" and \"V\" hover animation within the opening \"NOVA\" wordmark, specifically within headless Chromium. To accomplish this, I\'m setting up to capture a clean WebM video that demonstrates the animation. This will occur in ultra mode.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "hngCa9vDHazpz7IPpbHAwQI"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_4080716839347134330"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT\\nmkdir -p .playwright-cli && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli open --browser=chromium \\\"http://localhost:3000?autostart=1\\\" && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli resize 1440 900 && \\\\\\n  sleep 0.5 && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli video-start .playwright-cli/r2-nova-hover.webm && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli run-code \'async (page) => {\\n    const wm = page.getByTestId(\\\"hero-nova-wordmark\\\");\\n    const letterO = page.getByTestId(\\\"hero-nova-wordmark-o\\\");\\n    const letterV = page.getByTestId(\\\"hero-nova-wordmark-v\\\");\\n    const states = [];\\n    states.push(\\\"idle:\\\" + await wm.getAttribute(\\\"data-interaction-state\\\"));\\n\\n    await letterO.hover();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(550);\\n    states.push(\\\"hoverO:\\\" + await wm.getAttribute(\\\"data-interaction-state\\\"));\\n    await page.screenshot({ path: \\\".playwright-cli/r2-nova-o-nudge.png\\\" });\\n\\n    await letterV.hover();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(550);\\n    states.push(\\\"hoverV:\\\" + await wm.getAttribute(\\\"data-interaction-state\\\"));\\n    await page.screenshot({ path: \\\".playwright-cli/r2-nova-v-lift.png\\\" });\\n\\n    await page.mouse.move(720, 120);\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(550);\\n    states.push(\\\"afterLeave:\\\" + await wm.getAttribute(\\\"data-interaction-state\\\"));\\n    return states.join(\\\" -> \\\");\\n  }\' && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli video-stop && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli console\", \"Cwd\":\".\", \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":10000, \"toolAction\":\"Recording NOVA O-and-V hover interaction\", \"toolSummary\":\"Verify NOVA hover interaction\"}"
