  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Orchestrating App Integration**\n\nI\'m now carefully integrating `PageTransitionCurtain` and the `\342\200\242 TREATMENTS` dot into `/src/App.tsx`. I\'m double-checking every aspect of `handleNavigatePage` to ensure seamless GSAP timeline orchestration.\n\n\n**Refining Transition Logic**\n\nI\'m currently solidifying the ref and state management within `App.tsx` for flawless page transitions. I\'ve defined `transitionPhase`, `pendingPage`, and the refs for the transition curtain and main content. I\'m focusing intently on `handleNavigatePage`, accounting for reduced motion and ensuring the clicked item\'s active state (`\342\200\242 TREATMENTS` in this example) persists during the alabaster sheet animation. I\'m prioritizing instantaneous behavior when appropriate.\n\n\n**Implementing Page Transition**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the core logic within `handleNavigatePage` to ensure flawless execution. I\'m prioritizing proper GSAP timeline control, ensuring that running timelines are killed before building new ones. I\'m focusing on defining `curtain` and `mainEl` variables, retrieving transition timings, and updating `pendingPage` and `transitionPhase`. The timeline construction itself will start with the curtain animation and then build up.\n\n\n**Finalizing Scroll Behavior**\n\nI\'ve just added scroll behavior to the transition\'s conclusion. I\'m ensuring smooth scrolling to the target section after navigation.  I\'m handling cases where the section might not exist, defaulting to the top of the page. The GSAP initialization for the main element is now included, setting its position and opacity before the reveal. The overall timeline sequencing for the reveal phase is now finalized.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "Cn8Ca9d48vn7xg-NqJnIBA"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_7210416789919917760"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Add rising warm-alabaster curtain page transition and Odyss\303\251e nav indicator dot in App.tsx\", \"Instruction\":\"Import PageTransitionCurtain and pageTransition helpers, orchestrate GSAP rising-curtain navigation, add hover/pending dot indicator on Opening Horizon Navigation, and render PageTransitionCurtain\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":20, \"ReplacementContent\":\"import { Footer } from \'./components/Footer\';\\nimport { InteractiveNovaWordmark } from \'./components/InteractiveNovaWordmark\';\\nimport { PageTransitionCurtain } from \'./components/PageTransitionCurtain\';\\nimport { ConfirmedDemoBooking } from \'./utils/bookingLogic\';\\nimport {\\n  getPageTransitionTimings,\\n  shouldAnimatePageTransition,\\n  TransitionPhase,\\n} from \'./utils/pageTransition\';\", \"StartLine\":15, \"TargetContent\":\"import { Footer } from \'./components/Footer\';\\nimport { InteractiveNovaWordmark } from \'./components/InteractiveNovaWordmark\';\\nimport { ConfirmedDemoBooking } from \'./utils/bookingLogic\';\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":44, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const [savedBookings, setSavedBookings] = useState<ConfirmedDemoBooking[]>([]);\\n  const [transitionPhase, setTransitionPhase] = useState<TransitionPhase>(\'idle\');\\n  const [pendingPage, setPendingPage] = useState<ActivePage | null>(null);\\n\\n  const philosophyGridRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement | null>(null);\\n  const philosophySmallCardRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement | null>(null);\\n  const philosophyLargeCardRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement | null>(null);\\n  const mainRef = useRef<HTMLElement | null>(null);\\n  const transitionCurtainRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement | null>(null);\\n  const transitionTlRef = useRef<gsap.core.Timeline | null>(null);\", \"StartLine\":35, \"TargetContent\":\"  const [savedBookings, setSavedBookings] = useState<ConfirmedDemoBooking[]>([]);\\n\\n  const philosophyGridRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement | null>(null);\\n  const philosophySmallCardRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement | null>(null);\\n  const philosophyLargeCardRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement | null>(null);\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":121, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  useEffect(() => {\\n    return () => {\\n      transitionTlRef.current?.kill();\\n    };\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const handleNavigatePage = (page: ActivePage, sectionId?: string) => {\\n    const prefersReduced =\\n      typeof window !== \'undefined\' &&\\n      window.matchMedia(\'(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\').matches;\\n\\n    if (!shouldAnimatePageTransition(activePage, page, prefersReduced)) {\\n      setActivePage(page);\\n      window.requestAnimationFrame(() => {\\n        if (sectionId) {\\n          const el = document.getElementById(sectionId);\\n          if (el) {\\n            el.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \'smooth\' });\\n            return;\\n          }\\n        }\\n        window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: \'smooth\' });\\n      });\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    const curtain = transitionCurtainRef.current;\\n    const mainEl = mainRef.current;\\n    if (!curtain) {\\n      setActivePage(page);\\n      window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: \'auto\' });\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    // Cancel any overlapping transition cleanly\\n    transitionTlRef.current?.kill();\\n\\n    const timings = getPageTransitionTimings();\\n    setPendingPage(page);\\n    setTransitionPhase(\'rising\');\\n\\n    gsap.set(curtain, { yPercent: 100 });\\n\\n    const tl = gsap.timeline();\\n    transitionTlRef.current = tl;\\n\\n    // 1. Warm alabaster (#FBF9F5) sheet rises smoothly from bottom edge over current page\\n    tl.to(\\n      curtain,\\n      {\\n        yPercent: 0,\\n        duration: timings.riseDuration,\\n        ease: \'power4.inOut\',\\n      },\\n      0\\n    );\\n\\n    if (mainEl) {\\n      tl.to(\\n        mainEl,\\n        {\\n          y: -44,\\n          duration: timings.riseDuration,\\n          ease: \'power3.inOut\',\\n        },\\n        0\\n      );\\n    }\\n\\n    // 2. At peak full-viewport coverage, swap page cleanly at scroll top\\n    tl.add(() => {\\n      setTransitionPhase(\'swapping\');\\n      setActivePage(page);\\n      if (sectionId) {\\n        window.requestAnimationFrame(() => {\\n          const el = document.getElementById(sectionId);\\n          if (el) el.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \'auto\' });\\n          else window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: \'auto\' });\\n        });\\n      } else {\\n        window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: \'auto\' });\\n      }\\n      if (mainEl) {\\n        gsap.set(mainEl, { y: 34, opacity: 0 });\\n      }\\n    });\\n\\n    // 3. Curtain sweeps upward off-screen as incoming page glides smoothly into view\\n    tl.add(() => {\\n      setTransitionPhase(\'revealing\');\\n    }, `+=${timings.holdDuration}`);\\n\\n    tl.to(\\n      curtain,\\n      {\\n        yPercent: -100,\\n        duration: timings.revealDuration,\\n        ease: \'power4.inOut\',\\n      },\\n      \'<\'\\n    );\\n\\n    if (mainEl) {\\n      tl.to(\\n        mainEl,\\n        {\\n          y: 0,\\n          opacity: 1,\\n          duration: timings.revealDuration * 0.95,\\n          ease: \'power3.out\',\\n          clearProps: \'transform,opacity\',\\n        },\\n        \'<0.08\'\\n      );\\n    }\\n\\n    tl.add(() => {\\n      gsap.set(curtain, { yPercent: 100 });\\n      setPendingPage(null);\\n      setTransitionPhase(\'idle\');\\n      ScrollTrigger.refresh();\\n    });\\n  };\", \"StartLine\":106, \"TargetContent\":\"  const handleNavigatePage = (page: ActivePage, sectionId?: string) => {\\n    setActivePage(page);\\n    window.requestAnimationFrame(() => {\\n      if (sectionId) {\\n        const el = document.getElementById(sectionId);\\n        if (el) {\\n          el.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \'smooth\' });\\n          return;\\n        }\\n      }\\n      window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: \'smooth\' });\\n    });\\n  };\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":170, \"ReplacementContent\":\"      {/* MAIN VIEW SWITCHER */}\\n      <main ref={mainRef} className=\\\"flex-1 will-change-transform\\\">\", \"StartLine\":164, \"TargetContent\":\"      {/* MAIN VIEW SWITCHER */}\\n      <main className=\\\"flex-1\\\">\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":255, \"ReplacementContent\":\"                    {/* Right: Navigation Actions in Basel Grotesk */}\\n                    <nav\\n                      aria-label=\\\"Opening Horizon Navigation\\\"\\n                      className=\\\"font-basel flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6 md:gap-10 text-[11px] font-normal uppercase tracking-[0.04em]\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <button\\n                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                        onClick={() => handleNavigatePage(\'treatments\')}\\n                        className={`group/nav font-basel cursor-pointer py-1 inline-flex items-center gap-2 uppercase whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 transition-colors duration-300 ${\\n                          pendingPage === \'treatments\'\\n                            ? \'text-[#5A6582]\'\\n                            : \'text-[#FBF9F5] hover:text-[#5A6582]\'\\n                        }`}\\n                      >\\n                        <span\\n                          aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                          className={`inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#5A6582] transition-all duration-300 ${\\n                            pendingPage === \'treatments\'\\n                              ? \'opacity-100 scale-100\'\\n                              : \'opacity-0 scale-0 group-hover/nav:opacity-100 group-hover/nav:scale-100\'\\n                          }`}\\n                        />\\n                        <span>Treatments</span>\\n                      </button>\\n                      <button\\n                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                        onClick={() => handleNavigatePage(\'home\', \'our-approach\')}\\n                        className=\\\"group/nav font-basel cursor-pointer py-1 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[#FBF9F5] hover:text-[#5A6582] transition-colors duration-300 uppercase whitespace-nowrap shrink-0\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        <span\\n                          aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                          className=\\\"inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#5A6582] opacity-0 scale-0 group-hover/nav:opacity-100 group-hover/nav:scale-100 transition-all duration-300\\\"\\n                        />\\n                        <span>Concerns</span>\\n                      </button>\\n                      <button\\n                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                        onClick={() => handleNavigatePage(\'about\')}\\n                        className={`group/nav font-basel cursor-pointer py-1 inline-flex items-center gap-2 uppercase whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 transition-colors duration-300 ${\\n                          pendingPage === \'about\'\\n                            ? \'text-[#5A6582]\'\\n                            : \'text-[#FBF9F5] hover:text-[#5A6582]\'\\n                        }`}\\n                      >\\n                        <span\\n                          aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                          className={`inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#5A6582] transition-all duration-300 ${\\n                            pendingPage === \'about\'\\n                              ? \'opacity-100 scale-100\'\\n                              : \'opacity-0 scale-0 group-hover/nav:opacity-100 group-hover/nav:scale-100\'\\n                          }`}\\n                        />\\n                        <span>About</span>\\n                      </button>\\n                      <button\\n                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                        onClick={() => handleOpenBooking()}\\n                        className=\\\"font-basel hidden sm:inline-block cursor-pointer py-1 text-[#FBF9F5] hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity uppercase whitespace-nowrap shrink-0\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        Book Consultation\\n                      </button>\\n                    </nav>\", \"StartLine\":217, \"TargetContent\":\"                    {/* Right: Navigation Actions in Basel Grotesk */}\\n                    <nav\\n                      aria-label=\\\"Opening Horizon Navigation\\\"\\n                      className=\\\"font-basel flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6 md:gap-10 text-[11px] font-normal uppercase tracking-[0.04em]\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <button\\n                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                        onClick={() => handleNavigatePage(\'treatments\')}\\n                        className=\\\"font-basel cursor-pointer py-1 text-[#FBF9F5] hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity uppercase whitespace-nowrap shrink-0\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        Treatments\\n                      </button>\\n                      <button\\n                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                        onClick={() => handleNavigatePage(\'home\', \'our-approach\')}\\n                        className=\\\"font-basel cursor-pointer py-1 text-[#FBF9F5] hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity uppercase whitespace-nowrap shrink-0\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        Concerns\\n                      </button>\\n                      <button\\n                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                        onClick={() => handleNavigatePage(\'about\')}\\n                        className=\\\"font-basel cursor-pointer py-1 text-[#FBF9F5] hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity uppercase whitespace-nowrap shrink-0\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        About\\n                      </button>\\n                      <button\\n                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                        onClick={() => handleOpenBooking()}\\n                        className=\\\"font-basel hidden sm:inline-block cursor-pointer py-1 text-[#FBF9F5] hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity uppercase whitespace-nowrap shrink-0\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        Book Consultation\\n                      </button>\\n                    </nav>\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":546, \"ReplacementContent\":\"      {/* INTERACTIVE APPOINTMENT BOOKING DRAWER */}\\n      <BookingDrawer\\n        isOpen={bookingOpen}\\n        initialCategoryId={bookingPreset.categoryId}\\n        initialRitualId={bookingPreset.ritualId}\\n        onClose={() => setBookingOpen(false)}\\n        onBookingConfirmed={handleBookingConfirmed}\\n        savedBookings={savedBookings}\\n      />\\n\\n      {/* RISING ALABASTER CURTAIN PAGE TRANSITION LAYER */}\\n      <PageTransitionCurtain\\n        curtainRef={transitionCurtainRef}\\n        phase={transitionPhase}\\n      />\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\", \"StartLine\":532, \"TargetContent\":\"      {/* INTERACTIVE APPOINTMENT BOOKING DRAWER */}\\n      <BookingDrawer\\n        isOpen={bookingOpen}\\n        initialCategoryId={bookingPreset.categoryId}\\n        initialRitualId={bookingPreset.ritualId}\\n        onClose={() => setBookingOpen(false)}\\n        onBookingConfirmed={handleBookingConfirmed}\\n        savedBookings={savedBookings}\\n      />\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\"}], \"TargetFile\":\"/src/App.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Adding rising alabaster curtain transition to App.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Wire rising curtain transition in App.tsx\"}"
