);```### Result- [Video](.playwright-cli/r4-treatments-transition.webm)### ResultTotal messages: 3 (Errors: 0, Warnings: 0)Returning 1 messages for level \"info\"[INFO] %cDownload the React DevTools for a better development experience: https://react.dev/link/react-devtools font-weight:bold @ http://localhost:3000/node_modules/.vite/deps/react-dom_client.js?v=980e7826:15801Browser \'default\' closed\n\n### Latest snapshot (.playwright-cli/page-2026-11-22T05-49-45-213Z.yml)\n```yaml\n- generic [ref=e3]:\n  - banner \"Primary Sticky Navigation\":\n    - link \"NOVA\":\n      - /url: \"#top\"\n      - generic [aria-hidden]: \"N\"\n      - generic:\n        - generic [aria-hidden]: O\n        - generic [aria-hidden]: V\n      - generic [aria-hidden]: A\n    - navigation \"Main Navigation\":\n      - button \"Menu\"\n      - button \"Treatments\"\n      - button \"Concerns\"\n      - button \"About\"\n    - generic:\n      - button \"Book Consultation\"\n  - main [ref=e4]:\n    - article [ref=e5]:\n      - region \"Opening Hero\" [ref=e6]:\n        - generic [ref=e8]:\n          - link \"NOVA\" [ref=e10] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: \"#top\"\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e11]: \"N\"\n            - generic [ref=e12]:\n              - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e13]: O\n              - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e14]: V\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e15]: A\n          - paragraph [ref=e16]: Bespoke hair, skin & beauty artistry for timeless elegance.\n          - navigation \"Opening Horizon Navigation\" [ref=e17]:\n            - button \"Treatments\" [ref=e18] [cursor=pointer]\n            - button \"Concerns\" [ref=e20] [cursor=pointer]\n            - button \"About\" [ref=e22] [cursor=pointer]\n            - button \"Book Consultation\" [ref=e24] [cursor=pointer]\n        - generic [ref=e25]:\n          - generic \"Close-up editorial beauty film showing luminous natural skin texture and botanical serum ritual\" [ref=e28]\n          - gene