  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Browser Verification**\n\nI\'m working on refining the browser verification. I\'m focusing on clean execution, specifically using `waitForFunction` with a 10-second timeout, ensuring clean logging of the state, and capturing key visual states: Hero, Ethos, Modalities, and Aftercare+Journey. I also plan to verify the category click and ensure the booking drawer opens.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "EowCa5TMEd6P1MkPgcvP6Qo"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1320322343427232570"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT\\nmkdir -p .playwright-cli && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli open --browser=chromium \\\"http://localhost:3000?autostart=1\\\" && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli resize 1440 900 && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli run-code \'async (page) => {\\n    const navBtn = page.locator(\\\"nav[aria-label=\\\\\\\"Opening Horizon Navigation\\\\\\\"] button\\\", { hasText: \\\"Treatments\\\" });\\n    await navBtn.click();\\n    await page.waitForFunction(\\n      () => document.querySelector(\\\"#top\\\")?.getAttribute(\\\"data-view\\\") === \\\"treatments\\\" &&\\n            document.querySelector(\\\"[data-testid=\\\\\\\"page-transition-curtain\\\\\\\"]\\\")?.getAttribute(\\\"data-transition-phase\\\") === \\\"idle\\\",\\n      null,\\n      { timeout: 12000 }\\n    );\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(350);\\n    await page.screenshot({ path: \\\".playwright-cli/t1-hero.png\\\" });\\n\\n    // Scroll into Hero Ethos manifesto stage\\n    await page.evaluate(() => window.scrollTo(0, Math.round(window.innerHeight * 0.85)));\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(450);\\n    await page.screenshot({ path: \\\".playwright-cli/t1-ethos.png\\\" });\\n\\n    // Scroll into Modalities split (sticky left list + stacked salon media)\\n    await page.evaluate(() => {\\n      const el = document.querySelector(\\\"[data-testid=\\\\\\\"treatments-modalities\\\\\\\"]\\\");\\n      if (el) window.scrollTo(0, el.offsetTop + 190);\\n    });\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(600);\\n    await page.screenshot({ path: \\\".playwright-cli/t1-modalities.png\\\" });\\n\\n    // Click (2). Nails category & verify active state + click a ritual to verify booking drawer opens\\n    await page.getByTestId(\\\"modality-chapter-nails\\\").locator(\\\"button\\\").first().click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(450);\\n    const nailsActive = await page.getByTestId(\\\"modality-chapter-nails\\\").getAttribute(\\\"data-active\\\");\\n\\n    // Click first nail ritual button to verify booking drawer opens\\n    await page.getByTestId(\\\"modality-chapter-nails\\\").locator(\\\"ul button\\\").first().click();\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(300);\\n    const drawerVisible = await page.getByRole(\\\"dialog\\\").isVisible();\\n    await page.keyboard.press(\\\"Escape\\\");\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(250);\\n\\n    // Scroll to Pre & Aftercare band\\n    await page.evaluate(() => {\\n      const el = document.querySelector(\\\"[data-testid=\\\\\\\"treatments-aftercare\\\\\\\"]\\\");\\n      if (el) window.scrollTo(0, el.offsetTop);\\n    });\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(500);\\n    await page.screenshot({ path: \\\".playwright-cli/t1-aftercare.png\\\" });\\n\\n    // Check broken images\\n    const brokenImgs = await page.evaluate(() =>\\n      Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(\\\"img\\\"))\\n        .filter((img) => img.complete && img.naturalWidth === 0)\\n        .map((img) => img.getAttribute(\\\"src\\\"))\\n    );\\n\\n    return JSON.stringify({ nailsActive, drawerVisible, brokenImgs });\\n  }\' && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli console\", \"Cwd\":\".\", \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":10000, \"toolAction\":\"Verifying redesigned Treatments page captures\", \"toolSummary\":\"Verify redesigned Treatments page\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\234\003\n\231\003\001i\024}\023\247\331(\353jG\263!\b\353\302\373\316\027O\221>w\314\373\224[\274*\266f\306phj\021\231\364\273\037,\377\264\263~\030\245\217g\003\337\211\024\000\315\304m\027\321\221#\255\3143\324d\235q\340\266 \304\200:\246+\316\334HS\257V\315T\037\352fz\236:\245\032\377\270m\266\001\205\203\267\366\3478\256gk1\353~{\331L}\006\334\347\353\016\3017\320/p~\004\0034@\306\'U\322\306\250Q<\211.\213\025W\022O\224a\337-t\367*\3306e\351\204G\025\3347;6m\340\276Y\353.\aSiQ4\361h\215\316L\206\270\304V\020\372Pc:\267\"\232\204\246\215\233~\246\226\370\255\314\333\b/C\2011\347s]\331\277\361\233F\277\371!2U\246e\251\216\343N\222\211\245aN&\343\215\346`\302N\246V\317pc%q\313\3539m\016\235\352\241kr[\001\270\243\300\370$l\301w4\244P\026\310\345\363U_\t3\0179h\323Z\3041\212\245\360\270<rz\304\251VDx*\224 U\224\362\266>\226kG\304\335T\264z\323\003D\r\363B\257\203?X\355\264@2\367\354\330\230Q\324\024\372fh\372J\\\v\372\024\017\0045\312\213TR\025\027\371\325X0W\263\376^/\250U&/]\307\217\231\244\231\302\223+\001o\200\223\376\211\256~\237\350\360\237\367\003c\v\354i\335$\027i5d\235\263\215\032\2530`\306\373\356\357\303 *}"
