  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Discovering The Solution**\n\nI\'ve made a breakthrough! I just noticed something in `Header.tsx` line 79, specifically the `<InteractiveNovaWordmark>` component and the presence of the `transition-colors duration-` class. I believe this holds the key to the mystery I was working on. It\'s a fantastic catch! The discovery is already improving things.\n\n\n**Analyzing The Lag**\n\nI\'ve pinpointed the lag issue! Each letter in `<InteractiveNovaWordmark>` has `transition-colors duration-300` and `will-change-transform`. The parent `<a>`\'s color transition (300ms) causes the child `<span>` elements\' inherited `color` transitions to lag, especially with `will-change-transform` due to composited layers. This explains why \"NOVA\" stayed white initially.\n\n\n**Optimizing Visuals & Text**\n\nI\'ve got a couple more tweaks in mind. First, I\'m thinking of passing an explicit color or removing those redundant transitions on the parent and child elements. That should make the \"NOVA\" update more cleanly. I\'m also considering adjusting the `min-h` for the `treatments-aftercare` section for a more immersive feel, like the monochrome image filling the viewport on scroll. Finally, I\'ll review the price labels in `salonData.ts` to ensure consistency.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "bI8Ca_fGNv-o_uMP4MKswAs"
