    response: "The **Treatments** page has been redesigned into an editorial, scroll-choreographed experience tailored for **NOVA Unisex Salon**, preserving all existing salon services and booking flows.\n\n### What\342\200\231s Built\n- **Full-Viewport Opening Video & Manifesto**: Opens with a monochrome-graded salon skincare video and split editorial headline (`Guided by craft` / `refined through care.`). Scrolling softens the split title and dissolves in the indented right-hand NOVA ethos manifesto (`A treatment plan shaped for you`).\n- **Adaptive Sticky Header**: Renders in luminous ivory over the dark opening video, then transitions to midnight navy on warm alabaster as you enter the services below.\n- **Scroll-Synchronized Salon Modalities (`(1).` \342\200\223 `(4).`)**:\n  - Preserves all four NOVA treatment categories (**Facials & Skin Treatments**, **Manicure, Pedicure & Nail Art**, **Professional & Bridal Makeup**, and **Skincare Consultations**) along with every ritual, duration, and price.\n  - The sticky left column highlights the active chapter with its narrative description and unboxed bulleted rituals; clicking any chapter focuses it, and clicking any ritual opens the **Booking Drawer** pre-selected to that service.\n  - The right column stacks NOVA\342\200\231s full-bleed salon videos and photography in sync with the active chapter.\n- **Monochrome Pre & Aftercare Band**: Full-bleed monochrome salon backdrop pairing consultation guidance with structured pre-visit and post-visit care checklists and a direct consultation CTA.\n- **Your Journey & Stacked Macro Diptych**: Quiet alabaster editorial pause leading into centered stacked salon detail frames before the rolling marble and footer signature.\n- **Floating Section Index**: Fixed bottom-left desktop anchor navigator (`\342\200\242 Treatments`, `Our Modalities`, `Pre and Aftercare`) that tracks the current section and automatically switches contrast over dark vs. light surfaces.\n\n### Verified\n- **Unit Tests**: 18/18 tests passed, including the new Treatments scroll-choreography and active-section contrast tests.\n- **Build & Type Check**: Production build and TypeScript lint passed with zero errors.\n- **Browser Check (Desktop `1440\303\227900` & Mobile `390\303\227844`)**: Verified the video hero, scroll-dissolving manifesto, sticky `(1).`\342\200\223`(4).` chapter switching, Booking Drawer opening from a ritual item, Pre & Aftercare band, Your Journey section, zero console errors, zero broken images, and no horizontal overflow on mobile.\n- **Fixes Applied During Verification**: Deferred loading of below-the-fold modality videos so the page-transition curtain stays smooth, and simplified the header `NOVA` wordmark paint layers so it switches crisply from ivory to midnight navy when leaving the dark opening video."
