  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Browser Compatibility**\n\nAwesome! I\'ve confirmed a successful build, lint passed without errors, and the dev server restarted cleanly. My focus has now shifted to running a targeted browser verification round. This includes comprehensive still screenshots at key states and a short `.webm` scroll video to demonstrate how the images and videos transition smoothly, side by side.\n\n\n**Refining Scroll Test Script**\n\nI\'m making progress on the Playwright CLI script. It now handles viewport resizing, navigation, and waits for the page transition. I\'ve added a smooth scroll action to capture a video, and the script now grabs a mid-blend screenshot. The next step is to add DOM attribute readings and error checks.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "8pcCa_3iGKOKqtsPo8HEqQU"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_6249799481375493690"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT\\nmkdir -p .playwright-cli\\nplaywright-cli open --browser=chromium http://localhost:3000 && \\\\\\nplaywright-cli resize 1440 900 && \\\\\\nplaywright-cli run-code \'async (page) => {\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: /^Treatments$/i }).first().click();\\n  await page.waitForSelector(\\\"[data-testid=modality-vanishing-stage]\\\", { timeout: 12000 });\\n  await page.waitForFunction(() => {\\n    const c = document.querySelector(\\\"[data-testid=page-transition-curtain]\\\");\\n    return !c || c.getAttribute(\\\"data-transition-phase\\\") === \\\"idle\\\";\\n  }, { timeout: 12000 });\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(450);\\n\\n  const geom = await page.evaluate(() => {\\n    const track = document.querySelector(\\\"[data-testid=treatments-modalities-track]\\\");\\n    const stage = document.querySelector(\\\"[data-testid=modality-vanishing-stage]\\\");\\n    const trackRect = track.getBoundingClientRect();\\n    const trackTop = trackRect.top + window.scrollY;\\n    const trackHeight = track.offsetHeight;\\n    const stageHeight = stage.offsetHeight;\\n    return { trackTop, trackHeight, stageHeight, travel: Math.max(1, trackHeight - stageHeight) };\\n  });\\n\\n  // 1. Settle on Slide 0 (Facials)\\n  const startY = Math.round(geom.trackTop - 96);\\n  await page.evaluate((y) => window.scrollTo(0, y), startY);\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(450);\\n  await page.screenshot({ path: \\\".playwright-cli/vanish-start.png\\\" });\\n\\n  // 2. Capture mid-blend between Slide 0 (Facials vanishing) and Slide 1 (Nails scrolling into it)\\n  const midY = Math.round(startY + geom.travel * 0.205);\\n  await page.evaluate((y) => window.scrollTo(0, y), midY);\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(350);\\n  const midState = await page.evaluate(() => {\\n    const stage = document.querySelector(\\\"[data-testid=modality-vanishing-stage]\\\");\\n    const facials = document.querySelector(\\\"[data-testid=modality-media-facials]\\\");\\n    const nails = document.querySelector(\\\"[data-testid=modality-media-nails]\\\");\\n    const imgs = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(\\\"img\\\"));\\n    const brokenImgs = imgs.filter(img => img.complete && img.naturalWidth === 0).map(img => img.src);\\n    return {\\n      activeIndex: stage?.getAttribute(\\\"data-active-index\\\"),\\n      transitionProgress: stage?.getAttribute(\\\"data-transition-progress\\\"),\\n      facialsRole: facials?.getAttribute(\\\"data-slide-role\\\"),\\n      facialsOpacity: facials?.getAttribute(\\\"data-slide-opacity\\\"),\\n      nailsRole: nails?.getAttribute(\\\"data-slide-role\\\"),\\n      nailsOpacity: nails?.getAttribute(\\\"data-slide-opacity\\\"),\\n      nailsClip: nails?.getAttribute(\\\"data-slide-clip\\\"),\\n      brokenImgs,\\n    };\\n  });\\n  await page.screenshot({ path: \\\".playwright-cli/vanish-midblend.png\\\" });\\n\\n  // 3. Click chapter (3). Makeup -> verify jump & booking drawer trigger\\n  await page.locator(\\\"[data-testid=modality-chapter-makeup] button\\\").first().click();\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(900);\\n  const makeupState = await page.evaluate(() => {\\n    const stage = document.querySelector(\\\"[data-testid=modality-vanishing-stage]\\\");\\n    const makeupChapter = document.querySelector(\\\"[data-testid=modality-chapter-makeup]\\\");\\n    const makeupMedia = document.querySelector(\\\"[data-testid=modality-media-makeup]\\\");\\n    const facialsMedia = document.querySelector(\\\"[data-testid=modality-media-facials]\\\");\\n    return {\\n      activeIndex: stage?.getAttribute(\\\"data-active-index\\\"),\\n      makeupActive: makeupChapter?.getAttribute(\\\"data-active\\\"),\\n      makeupRole: makeupMedia?.getAttribute(\\\"data-slide-role\\\"),\\n      makeupOpacity: makeupMedia?.getAttribute(\\\"data-slide-opacity\\\"),\\n      facialsRole: facialsMedia?.getAttribute(\\\"data-slide-role\\\"),\\n    };\\n  });\\n  await page.screenshot({ path: \\\".playwright-cli/vanish-makeup.png\\\" });\\n\\n  // Click first ritual in Makeup chapter to verify Booking Drawer\\n  await page.locator(\\\"[data-testid=modality-chapter-makeup] ul button\\\").first().click();\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(350);\\n  const drawerVisible = await page.getByRole(\\\"dialog\\\").isVisible();\\n\\n  console.log(\\\"VERIFICATION_JSON:\\\", JSON.stringify({ geom, midState, makeupState, drawerVisible }));\\n}\' && \\\\\\nplaywright-cli console\", \"Cwd\":\"/app/applet\", \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":10000, \"toolAction\":\"Verifying vanishing scroll deck in Chromium\", \"toolSummary\":\"Verify vanishing scroll deck\"}"
