  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Visual Anatomy**\n\nI\'m deep-diving into the reference image. I\'m scrutinizing the menu drawer\'s visual anatomy, pixel by pixel, focusing on its refined details. The frosted appearance is a key element I\'m currently assessing. I\'m identifying all the distinct components!\n\n\n**Assessing Blurred Backdrop**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the blurred backdrop. Instead of a solid color takeover, it\'s a soft, frosted blur overlay! Clicking the \"Menu\" reveals a dreamily visible, blurred site behind. Dismissing is simple: clicking the blur closes the drawer smoothly.\n\n\n**Examining Panel Positioning**\n\nI\'m now carefully examining the panel\'s positioning in relation to the blurred backdrop and viewport. I\'m focusing on the right and top edges. I\'m seeing if it\'s flush or has a margin, considering both the fixed and flush right configurations, as well as the viewport width. I am now checking the close button, which is at the top left of the panel.\n\n\n**Pinpointing Component Placement**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the precise arrangement of elements within the drawer. Below \"CLOSE\", the numbered sections are stacked. The portrait thumbnail and blurb sit side-by-side mid-bottom. The solid midnight-navy contact card is at the base. I\'m noting the 20px margin on the navy box\'s right edge, which is either the drawer\'s `right-0 md:right-5` positioning or `pr-5`.\n\n\n**Refining Visual Specifics**\n\nI\'ve nailed the drawer\'s dimensions and positioning exactly. My focus shifted to the \"CLOSE\" button\'s fine details: the typography, its minimal style, and its top-left alignment. I\'m now digging into the numbered navigation. The grid setup is quite sharp! I\'m verifying the 2-column layout and typography styles of each item.\n\n\n**Implementing Hover Effects**\n\nI\'m now implementing the hover effects, focusing on the soft italic/opacity shift, like `hover:opacity-60 hover:translate-x-1 transition-all duration-300` and the smooth staggered slide-in animation, which seems like it might be achievable. I\'m focusing on those animations now.\n\n\n\n**Defining Menu Content**\n\nI\'m now defining the menu content. I\'ve got NOVA\'s address, contact details, and social/gift card links all mapped out. I\'m focusing on the implementation of these sections into the menu\'s structure.\n\n\n**Clarifying Menu Functionality**\n\nI\'m now clarifying the menu\'s functionality on different pages. I\'ve confirmed that the \"Menu\" button\'s behavior varies based on whether the user is on the home hero, scrolled down, or on a Treatments or About page. My review of `App.tsx` and `Header.tsx` revealed that the sticky header\'s \"Menu\" button handles all these cases. I\'m ensuring consistency across states and am now extracting the Menu drawer to a modular component, following Ultra Mode guidelines.\n\n\n**Formulating Verification Steps**\n\nI\'m now formulating a concise verification plan. I\'ll outline specific journeys to test: navigating to Treatments, clicking \'Menu,\' and verifying the frosted backdrop, right-side drawer, and content within the drawer. I\'ll also check interactions like clicking \"Book Consultation,\" which should close the drawer and open the Booking Drawer, as well as the \'CLOSE\' button and backdrop interaction, and then the navigation to the about page.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "DJ4Ca9LLNr6CkdUP5raBuAo"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_9253113217995598560"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useEffect, useState } from \'react\';\\nimport { SALON_CONFIG } from \'../data/salonData\';\\nimport type { ActivePage } from \'./Header\';\\n\\ninterface MenuDrawerProps {\\n  isOpen: boolean;\\n  activePage: ActivePage;\\n  onClose: () => void;\\n  onNavigatePage: (page: ActivePage, sectionId?: string) => void;\\n  onOpenBooking: () => void;\\n}\\n\\ninterface MenuLinkItem {\\n  number: string;\\n  label: string;\\n  isCurrent?: boolean;\\n  onSelect: () => void;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Editorial Right-Side Slide-Over Menu Drawer (Odyss\303\251e-Inspired for NOVA)\\n * - Frosted, soft-blurred full-viewport alabaster backdrop\\n * - Right-aligned alabaster sheet with top-left CLOSE control\\n * - Numbered (1. - 5.) editorial serif navigation\\n * - Paired vertical salon portrait & concise craft philosophy\\n * - Flush midnight-navy (#18224B) contact directory (A. / C. / S.)\\n */\\nexport const MenuDrawer: React.FC<MenuDrawerProps> = ({\\n  isOpen,\\n  activePage,\\n  onClose,\\n  onNavigatePage,\\n  onOpenBooking,\\n}) => {\\n  const [rendered, setRendered] = useState(isOpen);\\n  const [visible, setVisible] = useState(false);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (isOpen) {\\n      setRendered(true);\\n      const raf = window.requestAnimationFrame(() => {\\n        window.requestAnimationFrame(() => {\\n          setVisible(true);\\n        });\\n      });\\n      return () => window.cancelAnimationFrame(raf);\\n    }\\n\\n    setVisible(false);\\n    const timer = window.setTimeout(() => {\\n      setRendered(false);\\n    }, 420);\\n    return () => window.clearTimeout(timer);\\n  }, [isOpen]);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (!isOpen) return;\\n    const handleKeyDown = (e: KeyboardEvent) => {\\n      if (e.key === \'Escape\') {\\n        onClose();\\n      }\\n    };\\n    const prevOverflow = document.body.style.overflow;\\n    document.body.style.overflow = \'hidden\';\\n    window.addEventListener(\'keydown\', handleKeyDown);\\n\\n    return () => {\\n      document.body.style.overflow = prevOverflow;\\n      window.removeEventListener(\'keydown\', handleKeyDown);\\n    };\\n  }, [isOpen, onClose]);\\n\\n  if (!rendered) return null;\\n\\n  const { contact } = SALON_CONFIG;\\n\\n  const navItems: MenuLinkItem[] = [\\n    {\\n      number: \'1.\',\\n      label: \'Home\',\\n      isCurrent: activePage === \'home\',\\n      onSelect: () => {\\n        onClose();\\n        onNavigatePage(\'home\');\\n      },\\n    },\\n    {\\n      number: \'2.\',\\n      label: \'Treatments\',\\n      isCurrent: activePage === \'treatments\',\\n      onSelect: () => {\\n        onClose();\\n        onNavigatePage(\'treatments\');\\n      },\\n    },\\n    {\\n      number: \'3.\',\\n      label: \'Concerns\',\\n      onSelect: () => {\\n        onClose();\\n        onNavigatePage(\'home\', \'our-approach\');\\n      },\\n    },\\n    {\\n      number: \'4.\',\\n      label: \'About\',\\n      isCurrent: activePage === \'about\',\\n      onSelect: () => {\\n        onClose();\\n        onNavigatePage(\'about\');\\n      },\\n    },\\n    {\\n      number: \'5.\',\\n      label: \'Book Consultation\',\\n      onSelect: () => {\\n        onClose();\\n        onOpenBooking();\\n      },\\n    },\\n  ];\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div\\n      id=\\\"maison-aura-menu-panel\\\"\\n      role=\\\"dialog\\\"\\n      aria-modal=\\\"true\\\"\\n      aria-label=\\\"Nova Site Menu\\\"\\n      data-testid=\\\"nova-menu-drawer\\\"\\n      data-state={visible ? \'open\' : \'closing\'}\\n      className=\\\"fixed inset-0 z-50 overflow-hidden\\\"\\n    >\\n      {/* Frosted, Soft-Blurred Alabaster Backdrop */}\\n      <button\\n        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n        aria-label=\\\"Close navigation menu backdrop\\\"\\n        onClick={onClose}\\n        className={`absolute inset-0 h-full w-full cursor-default bg-[#FBF9F5]/62 backdrop-blur-xl transition-opacity duration-400 ease-out ${\\n          visible ? \'opacity-100\' : \'opacity-0\'\\n        }`}\\n      />\\n\\n      {/* Right-Side Editorial Sheet */}\\n      <aside\\n        className={`absolute inset-y-0 right-0 md:right-5 w-full max-w-[392px] bg-[#FBF9F5] text-[#18224B] shadow-[-18px_0_48px_rgba(24,34,75,0.07)] flex flex-col justify-between overflow-y-auto transition-transform duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] ${\\n          visible ? \'translate-x-0\' : \'translate-x-full\'\\n        }`}\\n      >\\n        {/* Top + Middle Editorial Zone */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-1 flex-col justify-between px-6 sm:px-7 pt-5 pb-7 gap-10\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            {/* Top-Left Minimalist CLOSE Control */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between pb-10 sm:pb-12\\\">\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={onClose}\\n                aria-label=\\\"Close navigation menu\\\"\\n                className=\\\"font-basel cursor-pointer py-1 text-[11px] font-normal uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-[#18224B] hover:opacity-55 transition-opacity focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-[#18224B] whitespace-nowrap shrink-0\\\"\\n              >\\n                Close\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Numbered Editorial Serif Navigation (1. - 5.) */}\\n            <nav aria-label=\\\"Menu Overlay Navigation\\\" className=\\\"space-y-1.5\\\">\\n              {navItems.map((item, index) => (\\n                <button\\n                  key={item.label}\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={item.onSelect}\\n                  style={{\\n                    transitionDelay: visible ? `${60 + index * 35}ms` : \'0ms\',\\n                  }}\\n                  className={`group cursor-pointer w-full grid grid-cols-[2.2rem_1fr] items-baseline text-left py-0.5 transition-all duration-300 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#18224B] ${\\n                    visible ? \'opacity-100 translate-y-0\' : \'opacity-0 translate-y-2\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-basel text-[10.5px] tabular-nums text-[#18224B]/65 group-hover:text-[#18224B] transition-colors\\\">\\n                    {item.number}\\n                  </span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-serif-editorial text-[1.72rem] sm:text-[1.82rem] font-light leading-[1.22] tracking-[-0.022em] text-[#18224B] inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 group-hover:opacity-65 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all duration-300\\\">\\n                    <span>{item.label}</span>\\n                    {item.isCurrent && (\\n                      <span\\n                        aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                        className=\\\"inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#18224B]/55\\\"\\n                      />\\n                    )}\\n                  </span>\\n                </button>\\n              ))}\\n            </nav>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Paired Vertical Salon Portrait + Concise Philosophy Statement */}\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-[106px_1fr] gap-4 items-start pt-4\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"aspect-[3/4.1] w-[106px] overflow-hidden bg-[#EAE6DF] shrink-0\\\">\\n              <img\\n                src=\\\"/images/nova-intro-portrait.jpg\\\"\\n                alt=\\\"Serene NOVA beauty editorial portrait\\\"\\n                referrerPolicy=\\\"no-referrer\\\"\\n                className=\\\"h-full w-full object-cover object-center\\\"\\n              />\\n            </div>\\n            <p className=\\\"font-basel text-[12.5px] font-normal leading-[1.52] tracking-[-0.008em] text-[#18224B] pt-0.5 pr-1\\\">\\n              We take a craft-led approach to timeless beauty, skin health, and restorative personal care.\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Bottom Solid Midnight-Navy Contact Card (A. / C. / S.) */}\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-[#18224B] text-[#FBF9F5] px-6 sm:px-7 py-7\\\">\\n          <dl className=\\\"space-y-4 font-basel text-[12px] font-normal leading-[1.52]\\\">\\n            {/* Address */}\\n            <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-[2.75rem_1fr] items-start\\\">\\n              <dt className=\\\"text-[#FBF9F5]/85\\\">\\n                <abbr title=\\\"Address\\\" className=\\\"no-underline\\\">\\n                  A.\\n                </abbr>\\n              </dt>\\n              <dd className=\\\"space-y-0.5 text-[#FBF9F5]/95\\\">\\n                <p>Nova Unisex Salon, Kingship by Kahlon</p>\\n                <p>UGF 04, 12A, Sector 16, Vrindavan Colony, Lucknow</p>\\n                <p className=\\\"pt-0.5\\\">\\n                  <a\\n                    href={contact.directionsUrl}\\n                    target=\\\"_blank\\\"\\n                    rel=\\\"noreferrer\\\"\\n                    className=\\\"underline decoration-[#FBF9F5]/45 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-[#FBF9F5] transition-colors\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    Get Directions\\n                  </a>\\n                </p>\\n              </dd>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Communication */}\\n            <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-[2.75rem_1fr] items-start\\\">\\n              <dt className=\\\"text-[#FBF9F5]/85\\\">\\n                <abbr title=\\\"Communication\\\" className=\\\"no-underline\\\">\\n                  C.\\n                </abbr>\\n              </dt>\\n              <dd className=\\\"space-y-0.5 text-[#FBF9F5]/95\\\">\\n                <p>\\n                  <a\\n                    href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}\\n                    className=\\\"hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    {contact.email}\\n                  </a>\\n                </p>\\n                <p>\\n                  <a\\n                    href={contact.phoneHref}\\n                    className=\\\"font-mono-tabular text-[11.5px] hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    {contact.phoneDisplay}\\n                  </a>\\n                </p>\\n              </dd>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Social Media */}\\n            <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-[2.75rem_1fr] items-start\\\">\\n              <dt className=\\\"text-[#FBF9F5]/85\\\">\\n                <abbr title=\\\"Social media\\\" className=\\\"no-underline\\\">\\n                  S.\\n                </abbr>\\n              </dt>\\n              <dd className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[#FBF9F5]/95\\\">\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={() => {\\n                    onClose();\\n                    onOpenBooking();\\n                  }}\\n                  className=\\\"cursor-pointer hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity\\\"\\n                >\\n                  Instagram\\n                </button>\\n                <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" className=\\\"text-[#FBF9F5]/45\\\">\\n                  /\\n                </span>\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={() => {\\n                    onClose();\\n                    onOpenBooking();\\n                  }}\\n                  className=\\\"cursor-pointer hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity\\\"\\n                >\\n                  Gift Cards\\n                </button>\\n              </dd>\\n            </div>\\n          </dl>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create Odyss\303\251e-inspired right-side frosted editorial MenuDrawer component for NOVA\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/MenuDrawer.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating MenuDrawer component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create MenuDrawer.tsx\"}"
