      full: "### Browser `default` opened with pid 4379.### Ran Playwright code```jsawait page.goto(\'http://localhost:3000\');```### Page- Page URL: http://localhost:3000/- Page Title: Nova \342\200\224 Maison Aura Beauty & Skin Sanctuary### Snapshot- [Snapshot](.playwright-cli/page-2026-11-22T09-04-35-047Z.yml)### Events- New console entries: .playwright-cli/console-2026-11-22T09-04-30-073Z.log#L1### Ran Playwright code```jsawait page.setViewportSize({ width: 1440, height: 900 });```### Ran Playwright code```jsawait (async (page) => {  // Open Book Consultation from Opening Horizon Navigation  await page.getByRole(\"navigation\", { name: \"Opening Horizon Navigation\" }).getByRole(\"button\", { name: \"Book Consultation\" }).click();  await page.waitForSelector(\"[data-testid=booking-sanctuary-modal][data-state=open]\", { timeout: 6000 });  await page.waitForTimeout(550);  // Switch category to Makeup & Bridal so we verify live dossier + video film switch  await page.getByRole(\"tab\", { name: /Makeup & Bridal/i }).click();  await page.waitForTimeout(400);  await page.screenshot({ path: \".playwright-cli/booking-step1-desktop.png\" });  // Advance to Step 2: Schedule  await page.getByRole(\"button\", { name: /Continue to Schedule/i }).click();  await page.waitForSelector(\"[data-testid=booking-sanctuary-modal][data-step=\\\"2\\\"]\", { timeout: 4000 });  await page.waitForTimeout(250);  // Try advancing without choosing a date -> verify honest validation alert  await page.getByRole(\"button\", { name: /Continue to Guest Details/i }).click();  const dateAlertCount = await page.getByRole(\"alert\").count();  // Pick second upcoming date tile + 02:30 PM slot  await page.locator(\"[data-testid=booking-sanctuary-modal] form button[aria-pressed]\").nth(1).click();  await page.getByRole(\"button\", { name: \"02:30 PM\" }).click();  await page.waitForTimeout(250);  await page.screenshot({ path: \".playwright-cli/booking-step2-desktop.png\" });  // Advance to Step 3: Guest Details  await page.getByRole(\"button\", { name: /Continue to Guest Details/i }).click();  await page.waitForSelector(\"[data-testid=booking-sanctuary-modal][data-step=\\\"3\\\"]\", { timeout: 4000 });  await page.waitForTimeout(250);  // Submit empty -> verify required field validation alerts appear  await page.getByRole(\"button\", { name: /Confirm Private Consultation/i }).click();  const step3AlertCount = await page.getByRole(\"alert\").count();  // Fill valid guest details + toggle Quiet silent ritual preference  await page.getByLabel(\"Full Name\").fill(\"Ananya Sharma\");  await page.getByLabel(\"Email Address\").fill(\"ananya@novasalon.in\");  await page.getByLabel(\"Phone Number\").fill(\"+91 98765 43210\");  await page.getByRole(\"button\", { name: /Quiet silent ritual/i }).click();  await page.getByRole(\"button\", { name: /Confirm Private Consultation/i }).click();  await page.waitForSelector(\"[data-testid=booking-success-state]\", { timeout: 4000 });  await page.waitForTimeout(350);  const confirmText = await page.locator(\"[data-testid=booking-success-state]\").textContent();  await page.screenshot({ path: \".playwright-cli/booking-confirmed-desktop.png\" });  // Mobile 390x844 check (start another ritual so we inspect Step 1 on mobile)  await page.getByRole(\"button\", { name: /Reserve Another Ritual/i }).click();  await page.setViewportSize({ width: 390, height: 844 });  await page.waitForTimeout(350);  const mobileOverflow = await page.evaluate(() => document.documentElement.scrollWidth > window.innerWidth);  await page.screenshot({ path: \".playwright-cli/booking-mobile.png\" });  console.log(\"BOOKING_VERIFY:\", JSON.stringify({    dateAlertCount,    step3AlertCount,    hasRefCode: Boolean(confirmText && confirmText.includes(\"REF \302\267 MA-\")),    hasGuestName: Boolean(confirmText && confirmText.includes(\"Ananya Sharma\")),    mobileOverflow,  }));})(page);```### ResultTotal messages: 3 (Errors: 0, Warnings: 0)Returning 1 messages for leve