          target_content: "    lead:\n      \'Every ritual at Maison Aura is guided by restraint, tactile skill, and respect for your natural features. We favour thoughtful consistency over aggressive trends.\',\n    paragraphs: [\n      \'We believe the most meaningful beauty treatments do not seek to disguise who you are. Instead, they create the quiet conditions in which healthy skin, cared-for hands, and unforced confidence can surface naturally.\',\n      \'From the temperature of our compresses to the pacing of our consultations, nothing is rushed and nothing is standardized. We take the time to understand what feels restorative to you.\',\n    ],\n    linkLabel: \'Discover our sanctuary & team\',\n  },\n\n  about: {\n    heroKicker: \'ABOUT MAISON AURA\',\n    heroTitle: \'A quiet house devoted to unhurried beauty rituals.\',\n    storyParagraphs: [\n      \'Conceived as an intimate alternative to high-turnover salons, Maison Aura was created for guests who value stillness as much as craft. Our space pairs warm limewashed walls, natural travertine stone, and filtered daylight to soften the transition from the outside world.\',"
