  planner_response {
    response: "All remaining **Maison Aura** references have been removed across the site and updated to **NOVA**.\n\n### What Changed\n- **Signature Ritual & Service Copy**: Renamed *The Maison Aura Signature Facial* to **The NOVA Signature Facial** (`nova-signature-facial`) and updated all chapter descriptions, consultation summaries, sanctuary philosophy copy, founder bio, and `ABOUT NOVA` heading to reflect **NOVA**.\n- **Consultation Reference Codes**: Updated generated booking reference codes from `MA-\342\200\246` to **`NOVA-\342\200\246`** (e.g., `NOVA-CL1118`).\n- **Page Metadata & DOM Identifiers**: Updated the browser `<title>` and OpenGraph title to **`NOVA \342\200\224 Unisex Salon & Beauty Sanctuary`** and renamed the menu panel accessibility ID to `nova-menu-panel`.\n\n### Verified\n- **Codebase Check**: Confirmed zero legacy `Maison Aura` or `MA-` references remain across application code and HTML metadata.\n- **Unit Tests**: 25/25 tests passed, including updated `NOVA-` reference code verification and a regression check ensuring `SALON_CONFIG` contains no legacy `Maison Aura` copy.\n- **Build & Type Check**: Production build and TypeScript lint passed with zero errors, and the dev server was restarted cleanly."
