    thinking: "**Analyzing Codebase Consistency**\n\nI\'m noticing the shared component `NavHoverLink` unifying navigation across `App.tsx`, `Header.tsx`, and `Footer.tsx`. This level of consistency suggests a deliberate design choice, and I\'m keen to examine the implications for the overall user experience and maintainability of the codebase. It creates an exact and refined Odyss\303\251e!\n\n\n"
