                 - generic [ref=e91]:\n                    - generic [ref=e92]: (3).\n                    - generic [ref=e93]:\n                      - heading \"Skilled beauty professionals\" [level=3] [ref=e94]\n                      - paragraph [ref=e95]: Our estheticians, nail artists, and makeup specialists unite refined manual technique with a gentle, observant touch\342\200\224prioritizing comfort, hygiene, and timeless aesthetic harmony.\n              - article [ref=e96]:\n                - button \"Close-up of elegant hands and natural manicure ritual (4). The art of everyday rituals We believe beauty should feel effortless long after you leave our chair. We pair in-salon treatments with simple, sustainable home rituals that support healthy skin and nails every day.\" [ref=e97] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - generic \"Close-up of elegant hands and natural manicure ritual\" [ref=e101]\n                  - generic [ref=e102]:\n                    - generic [ref=e103]: (4).\n                    - generic [ref=e104]:\n                      - heading \"The art of everyday rituals\" [level=3] [ref=e105]\n                      - paragraph [ref=e106]: We believe beauty should feel effortless long after you leave our chair. We pair in-salon treatments with simple, sustainable home rituals that support healthy skin and nails every day.\n        - region \"Concerns and Treatments Portals\":\n          - generic:\n            - button \"Skin concerns and bespoke consultations Concerns\":\n              - img \"Skin concerns and bespoke consultations\"\n              - generic: Concerns\n            - button \"Treatments and aesthetic artistry Treatments\":\n              - img \"Treatments and aesthetic artistry\"\n              - generic: Treatments\n      - region \"Our Philosophy and Method\" [ref=e107]:\n        - generic [ref=e108]:\n          - generic [ref=e109]: Our Philosophy\n          - generic [ref=e110]:\n            - heading \"Every treatment at