              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "      \'is founded upon a philosophy of integrity and quiet artistry in hair, skin, and bridal beauty. This manifests in bespoke treatments, a timeless approach rather than following trends, and maintaining a long-lasting relationship with our guests throughout their beauty journey. We understand that what makes you feel radiant evolves with every season of life, and we are here to support and guide you through these natural stages.\',"
