  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Executing Verification Capture**\n\nI\'m now initiating the verification capture on a `1440x900` desktop, targeting the About page Founder spread. I\'ll be using `trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT` for cleanup and a console check, all in Chromium. This should give us a visual verification of the page\'s render.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "5OkCa-ZlgdDPsg_OgZnZCQ"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_11378982059210340323"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT\\nmkdir -p .playwright-cli && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli open --browser=chromium \\\"http://localhost:3000?autostart=1\\\" && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli resize 1440 900 && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli run-code \'async (page) => {\\n    await page.getByRole(\\\"navigation\\\", { name: \\\"Opening Horizon Navigation\\\" }).getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: \\\"About\\\" }).click();\\n    await page.waitForSelector(\\\"[data-testid=\\\\\\\"about-founder-spread\\\\\\\"]\\\", { timeout: 10000 });\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(1500);\\n    await page.evaluate(() => {\\n      const el = document.querySelector(\\\"[data-testid=\\\\\\\"about-founder-spread\\\\\\\"]\\\");\\n      if (el) window.scrollTo({ top: el.getBoundingClientRect().top + window.scrollY - 68, behavior: \\\"instant\\\" });\\n    });\\n    await page.waitForTimeout(450);\\n    await page.screenshot({ path: \\\".playwright-cli/about-real-face-live.png\\\" });\\n  }\' && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli console\", \"Cwd\":\"/app/applet\", \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":10000, \"toolAction\":\"Verifying real-face owner portrait live on About page\", \"toolSummary\":\"Verify real-face portrait live\"}"
