tual\" [ref=e101]\n                  - generic [ref=e102]:\n                    - generic [ref=e103]: (4).\n                    - generic [ref=e104]:\n                      - heading \"The art of everyday rituals\" [level=3] [ref=e105]\n                      - paragraph [ref=e106]: We believe beauty should feel effortless long after you leave our chair. We pair in-salon treatments with simple, sustainable home rituals that support healthy skin and nails every day.\n        - region \"Concerns and Treatments Portals\":\n          - generic:\n            - button \"Skin concerns and bespoke consultations Concerns\":\n              - img \"Skin concerns and bespoke consultations\"\n              - generic: Concerns\n            - button \"Treatments and aesthetic artistry Treatments\":\n              - img \"Treatments and aesthetic artistry\"\n              - generic: Treatments\n      - region \"Our Philosophy and Method\" [ref=e107]:\n        - generic [ref=e108]:\n          - generic [ref=e109]: Our Philosophy\n          - generic [ref=e110]:\n            - heading \"Every treatment at NOVA is grounded in evidence-based skincare and the quiet art of aesthetic refinement. Our specialists combine anatomical precision with restorative techniques to achieve results that are both gentle and enduring.\" [level=3] [ref=e111]\n            - button \"Explore treatments\" [ref=e113] [cursor=pointer]\n        - generic [ref=e114]:\n          - generic [ref=e116]:\n            - generic \"Close-up beauty film of silk skincare cream on natural skin texture\" [ref=e119]\n            - paragraph [ref=e120]: Behind every treatment lies a commitment to science, research and refinement, ensuring results that are safe, precise and enduring.\n          - generic \"Extreme macro close-up of luminous skin texture and lips\" [ref=e123]\n      - region \"Editorial Visual Spread\" [ref=e124]:\n        - generic [ref=e125]:\n          - img \"Soft focus beauty texture\" [ref=e127]\n        