    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\nThe user has been refining the **About** page of the **NOVA Unisex Salon** web app (React + Vite + Tailwind CSS + GSAP):\n- **Prior completed requests in this session**:\n  - Redesigned `/src/components/AboutSection.tsx` and `/src/components/Header.tsx` to match the 4 Odyss\303\251e About page screenshots (`image_71ad232e.png`, `image_167c1f61.png`, `image_cd771dd9.png`, `image_a218be73.png`), featuring a full-viewport sunlit lounge hero (`Evolving / with you.` + right floating hydrangea still-life inset), alabaster philosophy manifesto + Kingship by Kahlon (Lucknow) contact details, tall Founder & Owner portrait on the left + flush sticky monochrome consultation hands-and-dossier inset on the right, and a 3-pillar Sanctuary Standards closing band.\n  - Iterated on the Founder & Owner portrait using the user\'s uploaded photo (`/public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-22_at_14.49.44_890263a1.jpeg`) so that her **exact real, unaltered face** is preserved 1-to-1 via photographic pixel compositing (ImageMagick `convert`) onto the generated editorial ivory double-breasted blazer with navy piping, midnight-navy trousers, rectangular timepiece, camel boucle sofa, and sheer white linen curtains.\n  - Fixed the chin-to-neck transition ridge (`owner_portrait_clean_neck_v2.jpg`) after user feedback (`image_88f4d6e9.png`).\n- **Current turn\'s active request**:\n  - User asked: *\"look at the outer area of cheeks what is that fix that\"* \342\200\224 referring to two subtle outer-cheek artifacts visible on the previous composite:\n    1. A thin ~4px pale beige outer-cheek sliver from the slightly wider base portrait peeking out along the lower-left cheek/hairline border.\n    2. A bright pink blush rim & soft seam along the viewer-right outer cheekbone next to the ear/hair.\n\n## 2. Progress\n- **Skills already read in prior turns**:\n  - `/skills/system_skills/ultra_mode/SKILL.md`\n  - `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md` and `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/references/1_ecommerce_retail.md`\n  - `/skills/system_skills/computer_use/SKILL.md`\n  - `/skills/system_skills/focus_mode/SKILL.md`\n- **Completed retouching & code edits for the current turn**:\n  - Refined the photographic composite via ImageMagick (`convert`) into `/src/assets/images/owner_portrait_clean_cheeks_v2.jpg`:\n    - Extended the lower-left face mask polygon by ~10px into her real dark glossy hair from the original uploaded photo so her real hair cleanly covers the 4px pale lower-left base-cheek sliver with zero halo or double-edge.\n    - Applied a gentle 3D studio side-light shading falloff (`-modulate 91,72,102.0` feathered softly over only the outermost right cheekbone rim) so her right cheek wraps smoothly into natural shadow beside her ear and dark hair with zero bright pink edge or vertical seam.\n    - Left 100% of her real face (eyes, eyebrows, nose, inner cheeks, lips, chin, expression) and the clean chin-to-neck transition untouched.\n  - Visually inspected tight HD zoom `/.playwright-cli/cheek_zoom_check2.png` \342\200\224 confirmed both outer cheek edges, jawline, hair strands, ear, and neck are 100% seamless and natural.\n  - Updated `/src/components/AboutSection.tsx` (line 8) to import `owner_portrait_clean_cheeks_v2.jpg`.\n- **Completed verification & checks (all run after the final code edit)**:\n  - `compile_applet` \342\206\222 **Build succeeded**.\n  - `lint_applet` (`tsc --noEmit`) \342\206\222 **Passed with 0 errors**.\n  - `restart_dev_server` \342\206\222 **Dev server restarted successfully**.\n  - **Live Browser Verification (`1440\303\227900` Chromium)** via `playwright-cli` (`http://localhost:3000?autostart=1` \342\206\222 clicked `About` \342\206\222 scrolled to `[data-testid=\"about-founder-spread\"]`):\n    - Captured & visually inspected `.playwright-cli/about-clean-cheeks-live.png`: confirmed the updated portrait renders cleanly live on the About page with smooth, natural outer cheek edges, zero pale sliver on the left jaw, natural right-cheek studio shadow falloff, exact real face, clean chin-to-neck transition, and flush monochrome consultation inset.\n    - Console log verified: `Total messages: 3 (Errors: 0, Warnings: 0)`.\n    - Browser closed cleanly (`Browser \'default\' closed`).\n- **What remains**:\n  - **Nothing to edit, build, or test!** All image retouching, code updates, compilation, linting, dev server restart, and live browser visual verification are 100% complete. Only the concise completion response to the user remains.\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- **Why AI face generation drifted vs. photographic compositing**: Passing her photo through generative diffusion (`generate_image`) subtly altered facial features/age lines even when referencing close-ups. Direct ImageMagick pixel compositing of her unmodified face from `/public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-22_at_14.49.44_890263a1.jpeg` at `1.64\303\227` scale (`+254+166` onto the `848\303\2271264` studio base portrait, exact `-8.13\302\260` head tilt match) preserved 100% true facial identity while keeping the generated ivory blazer, navy trousers, camel boucle sofa, and sheer white curtains.\n- **Outer-cheek & neck seam rules**: Extending the polygon into her own real dark hair on the left cheek edge (`x=68..76`) and down into her own smooth upper neck (`y=164`) eliminated all underneath base-portrait cheek/chin slivers, while a soft feathered side-light falloff along only the outermost right cheekbone neutralized the bright outdoor blush rim.\n- **Unit test suite**: All **25/25** unit tests in `src/utils/*.test.ts` passed in this session (no logic files were modified after that pass).\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- **Earlier AI face drift** (`about_owner_portrait_1795344836608.jpg`, `owner_portrait_exact_1795347575439.jpg`, `owner_portrait_faithful_1795347756012.jpg`): User reported the face looked changed. Fixed by abandoning AI face synthesis and performing direct photographic pixel compositing from `/public/assets/aistudio/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-22_at_14.49.44_890263a1.jpeg` via ImageMagick (`convert`).\n- **Earlier blue-channel eye/nostril tint & forehead clone-stamp smudge**: Fixed by using gentle warm-neutral color balance (`-modulate 98,84,102.0` with mild channel gamma) and knocking out only the tiny forehead tilak oval (`13\303\22715` feathered) to reveal clean studio forehead skin beneath.\n- **Earlier double-chin / extra neck ridge (`image_88f4d6e9.png`)**: Fixed by scaling `1.64\303\227` to match eye-to-chin 1-to-1 and extending the composite mask down into her real upper neck (`y=164`) while smoothing the base chin shadow underneath.\n- **Current turn outer-cheek artifacts** (4px pale lower-left base-cheek sliver + bright pink right-cheek rim): Fixed in two iterations (`owner_portrait_clean_cheeks.jpg` \342\206\222 `owner_portrait_clean_cheeks_v2.jpg`) by extending the lower-left mask into her real dark hair and softening the outermost right cheekbone highlight into natural studio side shadow.\n- **Note on `delete_file` on binary `.jpg`**: `delete_file` errored earlier with charset detection on binary `.jpg` files; unused intermediate `.jpg` files in `src/assets/images/` are harmless because Vite only bundles statically imported assets (`owner_portrait_clean_cheeks_v2.jpg`).\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- Active portrait imported by `/src/components/AboutSection.tsx`: `src/assets/images/owner_portrait_clean_cheeks_v2.jpg`.\n- Dev server is running with the freshly compiled, lint-clean build.\n- All Playwright Chromium sessions are closed (`Browser \'default\' closed`).\n- Visual capture `.playwright-cli/about-clean-cheeks-live.png` has been inspected and verified clean.\n\n## 6. Next Steps\n1. **No further code changes, image edits, or tool calls are needed.**\n2. Immediately deliver a concise, scannable completion response explaining:\n   - What was fixed on the outer cheek areas of the Founder portrait (removed the thin pale lower-left cheek sliver by blending cleanly along her real hair edge, and softened the outer right cheekbone blush highlight into natural studio side-light falloff\342\200\224while keeping her exact real face and clean neck completely unchanged).\n   - What was verified (TypeScript build & lint passed with 0 errors, and live desktop `1440\303\227900` Chromium inspection of the **About** page confirmed both outer cheek edges render smoothly with zero console errors or warnings).\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- Follow `ultra-mode` honest reporting (report only what was actually verified).\n- Keep the response concise and scannable, without internal file paths or hype.\n- Never rename `metadata.json`.\n</summary>"
