  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Discovering Color Physics**\n\nAHA! The color physics are finally clicking! That RIGHT PANEL of `jaw_tight_compare3.png` is the key. Specifically, the `-modulate 98,92,104` setting is illuminating everything. I think I\'ve reached a 1000% clearer understanding now!\n\n\n**Unveiling Color Shifts**\n\nI\'ve made a breakthrough! Examining the left panel of `jaw_tight_compare3.png` again, the yellowish-greenish/olive tint along the jaw edges is crucial. That hue shift explains the color variations in the photo. The lower-left and lower-right cheeks were reflecting light with the saree and foliage, and the hue setting pushed it even further toward olive! This is a massive revelation!\n\n\n"
    message_id: "QBEDa-qHHPiiqtsP3N25-AM"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_5181514102625085593"
