  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Color Data**\n\nI\'ve got some promising data! The color readings from the cheeks are showing interesting ratios and differences. The mid-left cheek gives R/G = 1.435, G/B = 1.413, and a +64 difference between R and G. The mid-right data similarly shows R/G = 1.413, G/B ratios. This is exciting, I\'m going to look deeper.\n\n\n**Examining Ratios Further**\n\nI\'ve got more interesting data to analyze now! The lower jaw\'s color ratios, specifically the lower-left, lower-right, and outer-right jaw zones, deviate significantly from the ratios observed in the mid-cheeks. My data suggests multiplying the Red value by approximately 1.07 to align the color ratios with the warmer peach tones I saw earlier. I also think I should adjust the blue value, to bring them closer to the mid-cheek and neck values. I see some stray fuzz that could be cleaned too.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "dhEDa8DiNIjpz7IPoKyBiQE"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_10152541900462399247"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"python3 -c \'\\nimport subprocess\\n\\n# Start from v3_left_bg.png (which is v2_394.png with the crisp warm-black studio hair replacing\\n# the bluish halo outside the lower-left jaw, and 100% untouched forehead/eyes/nose/lips/chin/neck!)\\n\\n# Also ensure lower-left jaw edge is crisp (no hair encroaching on skin, no bluish pixel outside skin)\\nsubprocess.run([\\n    \\\"convert\\\", \\\"-size\\\", \\\"394x394\\\", \\\"xc:black\\\",\\n    \\\"-fill\\\", \\\"white\\\",\\n    \\\"-draw\\\", \\\"polygon 126,184 156,188 164,238 162,243 148,234 137,220 130,204\\\",\\n    \\\"-blur\\\", \\\"0x2.2\\\",\\n    \\\".playwright-cli/l_jaw_crisp.png\\\"\\n], check=True)\\n\\nsubprocess.run([\\n    \\\"convert\\\", \\\".playwright-cli/v3_left_bg.png\\\",\\n    \\\".playwright-cli/v2_394.png\\\",\\n    \\\".playwright-cli/l_jaw_crisp.png\\\",\\n    \\\"-compose\\\", \\\"Over\\\", \\\"-composite\\\",\\n    \\\".playwright-cli/v4_base.png\\\"\\n], check=True)\\n\\n# Now create a soft feathered color-harmony mask covering ONLY:\\n#  1) Lower-left cheek near the jaw (x=126..168, y=194..244)\\n#  2) Lower-right cheek & outer jaw near ear (x=212..253, y=172..242)\\n# Shifting ONLY the olive/greyish R/G/B ratio (1.33 -> 1.43) into exact warm rosy-peach skin harmony\\n# matching her mid-cheeks (211,147,104) and neck (188,129,91)!\\n\\nsubprocess.run([\\n    \\\"convert\\\", \\\"-size\\\", \\\"394x394\\\", \\\"xc:black\\\",\\n    \\\"-fill\\\", \\\"white\\\",\\n    # Lower-left cheek near jaw\\n    \\\"-draw\\\", \\\"polygon 126,192 162,202 168,242 150,242 134,226 126,208\\\",\\n    # Lower-right cheek & outer jaw (up to ear edge x=252)\\n    \\\"-draw\\\", \\\"polygon 214,186 250,174 254,198 248,220 234,238 212,244 206,226\\\",\\n    \\\"-blur\\\", \\\"0x10\\\",\\n    \\\".playwright-cli/jaw_warmth_mask.png\\\"\\n], check=True)\\n\\n# Apply exact warm peach balance: boost R slightly (+6%), calm G slightly (-1%), reduce cool B (-7%)\\n# so olive/ashy shadow turns into healthy warm peach shadow matching her cheek & neck!\\nsubprocess.run([\\n    \\\"convert\\\", \\\".playwright-cli/v4_base.png\\\",\\n    \\\"(\\\", \\\".playwright-cli/v4_base.png\\\",\\n         \\\"-channel\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"-gamma\\\", \\\"1.10\\\",\\n         \\\"-channel\\\", \\\"G\\\", \\\"-gamma\\\", \\\"0.985\\\",\\n         \\\"-channel\\\", \\\"B\\\", \\\"-gamma\\\", \\\"0.905\\\",\\n         \\\"+channel\\\",\\n    \\\")\\\",\\n    \\\".playwright-cli/jaw_warmth_mask.png\\\",\\n    \\\"-compose\\\", \\\"Over\\\", \\\"-composite\\\",\\n    \\\".playwright-cli/v4_warmed.png\\\"\\n], check=True)\\n\\n# Second tiny pass ONLY on the outermost 8px of the lower-right jaw/cheek near the ear (x=234..254, y=174..228)\\n# where B was highest (158,118,93 -> cool grey-pink), giving it extra warm peach harmony & subtle smooth blend\\nsubprocess.run([\\n    \\\"convert\\\", \\\"-size\\\", \\\"394x394\\\", \\\"xc:black\\\",\\n    \\\"-fill\\\", \\\"white\\\",\\n    \\\"-draw\\\", \\\"polygon 234,174 254,172 254,212 240,232 230,224 236,198\\\",\\n    \\\"-blur\\\", \\\"0x7\\\",\\n    \\\".playwright-cli/outer_r_warm_mask.png\\\"\\n], check=True)\\n\\nsubprocess.run([\\n    \\\"convert\\\", \\\".playwright-cli/v4_warmed.png\\\",\\n    \\\"(\\\", \\\".playwright-cli/v4_warmed.png\\\",\\n         \\\"-channel\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"-gamma\\\", \\\"1.06\\\",\\n         \\\"-channel\\\", \\\"G\\\", \\\"-gamma\\\", \\\"0.99\\\",\\n         \\\"-channel\\\", \\\"B\\\", \\\"-gamma\\\", \\\"0.92\\\",\\n         \\\"+channel\\\",\\n         \\\"-modulate\\\", \\\"101,106,99.5\\\",\\n    \\\")\\\",\\n    \\\".playwright-cli/outer_r_warm_mask.png\\\",\\n    \\\"-compose\\\", \\\"Over\\\", \\\"-composite\\\",\\n    \\\".playwright-cli/v4_final.png\\\"\\n], check=True)\\n\\n# Check resulting RGB ratios!\\ndef avg_rgb(img, geom):\\n    return subprocess.check_output([\\\"convert\\\", img, \\\"-crop\\\", geom, \\\"+repage\\\", \\\"-resize\\\", \\\"1x1!\\\", \\\"-fo