ds to the season, and what brings you a sense of calm restoration.\n              - button \"Book Consultation\" [ref=e45] [cursor=pointer]\n      - generic [ref=e48]:\n        - region [ref=e49]:\n          - generic [ref=e50]:\n            - generic [ref=e52]:\n              - generic [ref=e53]:\n                - generic [ref=e54]: \"01\"\n                - generic [ref=e55]: /\n                - generic [ref=e56]: \"04\"\n              - heading \"Why NOVA?\" [level=2] [ref=e57]\n              - generic [ref=e58]:\n                - button \"Previous chapter\" [ref=e59] [cursor=pointer]: \342\206\220\n                - button \"Next chapter\" [ref=e60] [cursor=pointer]: \342\206\222\n            - generic [ref=e61]:\n              - article [ref=e62]:\n                - button \"Serene facial treatment ritual in warm diffused light (1). Active Chapter A considered experience More than an appointment, NOVA is a quiet pause. From warm linen and softened acoustics to unhurried transition time between rituals, every detail is composed to restore stillness.\" [pressed] [ref=e63] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - generic \"Serene facial treatment ritual in warm diffused light\" [ref=e67]\n                  - generic [ref=e68]:\n                    - generic [ref=e69]:\n                      - text: (1).\n                      - generic [ref=e70]: Active Chapter\n                    - generic [ref=e71]:\n                      - heading \"A considered experience\" [level=3] [ref=e72]\n                      - paragraph [ref=e73]: More than an appointment, NOVA is a quiet pause. From warm linen and softened acoustics to unhurried transition time between rituals, every detail is composed to restore stillness.\n              - article [ref=e74]:\n                - button \"Macro beauty portrait highlighting natural skin texture and hydration (2). Care tailored to you No two complexions or schedules are alike. Each facial, manicure, or makeup session is adapted on the day of your visit to match your skin\342\200\231s current condition and personal preferences.\" [ref=e75] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - generic \"Macro beauty portrait highlighting natural skin texture and hydration\" [ref=e79]\n                  - generic [ref=e80]:\n                    - generic [ref=e81]: (2).\n                    - generic [ref=e82]:\n                      - heading \"Care tailored to you\" [level=3] [ref=e83]\n                      - paragraph [ref=e84]: No two complexions or schedules are alike. Each facial, manicure, or makeup session is adapted on the day of your visit to match your skin\342\200\231s current condition and personal preferences.\n              - article [ref=e85]:\n                - button \"Esthetician hands performing a precise, gentle facial massage (3). Skilled beauty professionals Our estheticians, nail artists, and makeup specialists unite refined manual technique with a gentle, observant touch\342\200\224prioritizing comfort, hygiene, and timeless aesthetic harmony.\" [ref=e86] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - generic \"Esthetician hands performing a precise, gentle facial massage\" [ref=e90]\n                  - generic [ref=e91]:\n                    - generic [ref=e92]: (3).\n                    - generic [ref=e93]:\n                      - heading \"Skilled beauty professionals\" [level=3] [ref=e94]\n                      - paragraph [ref=e95]: Our estheticians, nail artists, and makeup specialists unite refined manual technique with a gentle, observant touch\342\200\224prioritizing comfort, hygiene, and timeless aesthetic harmony.\n              - article [ref=e96]:\n                - button \"Close-up of elegant hands and natural manicure ritual (4). The art of everyday rituals We believe beauty should feel effortless long after you leave our chair. We pair in-salon treatments with simple, sustainable home rituals that support healthy skin and nails every day.\" [ref=e97] [cursor=pointer]:\n         