  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Observing Image Perfection**\n\nI\'m completely blown away by the right panel of the image! It\'s pure editorial perfection, a standout example. Comparing it to the left side, the initial warm orange tones on the face and neck are so different, I can\'t look away from the incredible transformation.\n\n\n**Analyzing Skin Tones**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the subtle skin tone variations, particularly in the right panel. I\'ve pinpointed an area on the outer cheekbone and upper forehead where the blue channel lift created a slight coolness. Now, after micro-polishing, a tiny whisper of cool lilac-pink is noticeable on her outer-right cheek. The forehead matches her chest\'s creamy tone as intended, with the blend dialed in at 88% correction to smooth everything out perfectly.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "IRkDa_eBMqiH28oPxOuTuQU"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_6555344397677093251"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"python3 -c \'\\nimport subprocess\\n\\nsrc = \\\"src/assets/images/owner_portrait_clean_jaw.jpg\\\"\\n\\n# Spatial mask: 100% on cheeks/nose/chin/upper-neck, 18% on forehead (already matching chest),\\n# 35% on lips (preserve natural rosy lip warmth)\\nsubprocess.run([\\n    \\\"convert\\\", \\\"-size\\\", \\\"848x1264\\\", \\\"xc:black\\\",\\n    \\\"-fill\\\", \\\"white\\\",\\n    \\\"-draw\\\", \\\"polygon 365,302 520,300 518,415 500,478 385,478 375,415 358,350\\\",\\n    \\\"-fill\\\", \\\"gray18\\\",\\n    \\\"-draw\\\", \\\"polygon 378,242 440,228 508,258 518,302 365,302\\\",\\n    \\\"-blur\\\", \\\"0x18\\\",\\n    \\\"-fill\\\", \\\"gray35\\\",\\n    \\\"-draw\\\", \\\"ellipse 438,376 26,11 0,360\\\",\\n    \\\"-blur\\\", \\\"0x5\\\",\\n    \\\".playwright-cli/tone_spatial_mask3.png\\\"\\n], check=True)\\n\\nsubprocess.run([\\n    \\\"convert\\\", \\\".playwright-cli/tone_spatial_mask3.png\\\", \\\".playwright-cli/tone_lum_gate.png\\\",\\n    \\\"-compose\\\", \\\"Multiply\\\", \\\"-composite\\\",\\n    \\\".playwright-cli/tone_skin_mask3.png\\\"\\n], check=True)\\n\\n# Balanced studio daylight match (healthy warm-creamy skin, zero lilac-pink cast, exact match to lower neck & chest!)\\nsubprocess.run([\\n    \\\"convert\\\", src,\\n    \\\"(\\\", src,\\n         \\\"-channel\\\", \\\"R\\\", \\\"-gamma\\\", \\\"0.975\\\",\\n         \\\"-channel\\\", \\\"G\\\", \\\"-gamma\\\", \\\"1.12\\\",\\n         \\\"-channel\\\", \\\"B\\\", \\\"-gamma\\\", \\\"1.24\\\",\\n         \\\"+channel\\\",\\n         \\\"-modulate\\\", \\\"101,96,100.3\\\",\\n    \\\")\\\",\\n    \\\".playwright-cli/tone_skin_mask3.png\\\",\\n    \\\"-compose\\\", \\\"Over\\\", \\\"-composite\\\",\\n    \\\".playwright-cli/tone_step1.png\\\"\\n], check=True)\\n\\n# Tiny targeted neutralization ONLY on the faint outer-right cheekbone lilac-pink blush (x=482..508, y=322..372)\\nsubprocess.run([\\n    \\\"convert\\\", \\\"-size\\\", \\\"848x1264\\\", \\\"xc:black\\\",\\n    \\\"-fill\\\", \\\"white\\\",\\n    \\\"-draw\\\", \\\"ellipse 494,346 15,24 0,360\\\",\\n    \\\"-blur\\\", \\\"0x9\\\",\\n    \\\".playwright-cli/r_lilac_mask.png\\\"\\n], check=True)\\n\\nsubprocess.run([\\n    \\\"convert\\\", \\\".playwright-cli/tone_step1.png\\\",\\n    \\\"(\\\", \\\".playwright-cli/tone_step1.png\\\",\\n         \\\"-channel\\\", \\\"B\\\", \\\"-gamma\\\", \\\"0.93\\\",\\n         \\\"-channel\\\", \\\"G\\\", \\\"-gamma\\\", \\\"1.02\\\",\\n         \\\"+channel\\\",\\n         \\\"-modulate\\\", \\\"100,92,100.8\\\",\\n    \\\")\\\",\\n    \\\".playwright-cli/r_lilac_mask.png\\\",\\n    \\\"-compose\\\", \\\"Over\\\", \\\"-composite\\\",\\n    \\\"-quality\\\", \\\"95\\\",\\n    \\\"src/assets/images/owner_portrait_matched_tone.jpg\\\"\\n], check=True)\\n\\ndef avg_rgb(img, geom):\\n    return subprocess.check_output([\\n        \\\"convert\\\", img, \\\"-crop\\\", geom, \\\"+repage\\\", \\\"-resize\\\", \\\"1x1!\\\",\\n        \\\"-format\\\", \\\"%[fx:int(255*r)],%[fx:int(255*g)],%[fx:int(255*b)] (lum=%[fx:int(255*(0.299*r+0.587*g+0.114*b))])\\\", \\\"info:\\\"\\n    ]).decode().strip()\\n\\nout = \\\"src/assets/images/owner_portrait_matched_tone.jpg\\\"\\nfor name, geom in [\\n    (\\\"Forehead\\\",      \\\"30x20+415+275\\\"),\\n    (\\\"Mid-left chk\\\",  \\\"24x24+395+338\\\"),\\n    (\\\"Mid-right chk\\\", \\\"24x24+468+332\\\"),\\n    (\\\"Outer-r blush\\\", \\\"16x20+486+336\\\"),\\n    (\\\"Chin\\\",          \\\"24x16+428+395\\\"),\\n    (\\\"Upper neck\\\",    \\\"34x22+430+430\\\"),\\n    (\\\"Lower neck\\\",    \\\"40x30+425+485\\\"),\\n    (\\\"Chest/decoll\\\",  \\\"44x34+415+535\\\"),\\n    (\\\"Hand/knuckles\\\", \\\"36x28+372+868\\\"),\\n]:\\n    print(f\\\"{name:15s}: {avg_rgb(out, geom)}\\\")\\n\\nsubprocess.run([\\n    \\\"convert\\\", out, \\\"-crop\\\", \\\"480x760+185+170\\\", \\\"+repage\\\", \\\"-resize\\\", \\\"480x760\\\",\\n    \\\".playwright-cli/tone_check_after2.png\\\"\\n], check=True)\\nsubprocess.run([\\n    \\\"convert\\\", \\\"+append\\\", \\\".playwright-cli/tone_check_before.png\\\", \\\".playwright-cli/tone_check_after2.png\\\",\\n    \\\".playwright-cli/tone_before_after2.png\\\"\\n], check=True)\\n\'\", \"Cwd\":\".\", \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":10000, \"toolAction\":\"Polishing warm-creamy studio daylight harmony\", \"toolSummary\":\"Polish studio daylight harmony\"}"
